 "hazard_discussion": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<figure class=\"image afp-photoswipe align-center\">\n<div class=\"afp-image-container\"><a title=\"KPAC movie and fundraiser night!\" href=\"https://orpheumflagstaff.com/\"><img style=\"width: 360px; height: 360px;\" src=\"https://prod-images.seetickets.us/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJwcm9kLXNpaC5zZWV0aWNrZXRzdXNhLnVzIiwia2V5IjoiMzRjMTllMTUtZTkxYS00NDMzLWE3M2YtNGIwMzIyMDZlMzY1IiwiZWRpdHMiOnt9fQ==\" alt=\"kpac movie and fundraiser night\"></a></div>\n</figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Thank You, Flagstaff, Orpheum Theater, and TGR for Another Great Fall Fundraiser!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>KPAC's avalanche education courses are posted for the upcoming season.<br><a title=\"KPAC Courses\" href=\"https://kachinapeaks.org/courses\">kachinapeaks.org/courses</a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Expect avalanche forecasts to resume in early December, possibly sooner depending on conditions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Precipitation for Northern Arizona is expected to be above average through January. El Ni&ntilde;o continues to strengthen and will likely remain strong through winter into early spring.&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/analysis_monitoring/lanina/enso_evolution-status-fcsts-web.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.cpc.ncep.noaa.gov/products/analysis_monitoring/lanina/enso_evolution-status-fcsts-web.pdf</a></p>",
